Module
  name: test_bosstour
  description: TEST ONLY (boss-video.yml, O689) - with the environment variable CHAOS_BOSSTOUR=1 it logs in with the staff character of CHAOS_LIVE_ACCOUNT / _PASSWORD, goes invisible, waits for the pinnacle fight of the tester bots, follows the party through it and exits when the fight ends, so a manual workflow can film it. Without the variable it does nothing, no window, no hotkey, not in the hub menu
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: false
  scripts: [ bosstourlogic, bosstour ]
  dependencies:
    - client_entergame
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 1200
  @onLoad: ChaosBossTour.init()
  @onUnload: ChaosBossTour.terminate()
